{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1510144-xp-character-generation","id":1510144,"title":"XP character generation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-29T19:09:45-07:00","id":1510144,"title":"XP character generation","content":"I've read many people who are not fond of using bonus points for character generation write that they use xp instead. Is this typically simply giving the player 45(?) xp instead of 15 bonus points, or is it more involved?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T19:49:49-07:00","id":1510148,"title":"","content":"I don't think there's one universal method here. The overall issue people have, is that the game creates a bunch of wonky incentives not just with bonus points, but also the linear creation points and exponential costs for most things.<br /> <br /> The two most common approaches I've seen:<br /> <br /> 1) You get a lot of XP, either one big pile or a few sorted piles, that replace creation points and bonus points.<br /> <br /> 2) The XP costs are adjusted to be flat costs (usually the CofD numbers are used as a base model), and then a smaller starting XP like you're thinking to replace bonus points.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:18:18-07:00","id":1510254,"title":"","content":"My current character Gen using Flat-XP Progression: <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table align=\"center\" class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 500px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Conversion Rate</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Must Spend during Creation</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Total</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Attributes</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">10</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">80/60/40</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">180</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Abilities</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">5 (4 if favored)</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">140</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">140</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Merits</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">3 (per actual dot)</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">30</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">30</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Charms</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">10 (8 if favored)</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">150</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">150</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Bonus</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">4.5 (rounded up to 5)</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">75</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">75</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Total</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">575</td> </tr> </table></div> Note: I have been a bit generous with my conversion, I am giving 5xp per ability dot (when it comes down to four if favored, same with charms as in using unfavored costs.)<br /> <br /> My BP conversion also was technically 4.5 per BP but I rounded it up to 5.<br /> <br /> You could just lower the number of BP Xp but thats up to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4678-tryingtobeslim","name":"TryingToBeSlim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T15:50:37-07:00","id":1510279,"title":"","content":"Thank you. I suppose for a Lunar you'd do 90/70/50 (210 total) for attributes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":872,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","user":"Apromor","date":". 04-30-2023, 06:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T11:11:26-07:00","id":1510379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Apromor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1510144-xp-character-generation?p=1510279#post1510279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you. I suppose for a Lunar you'd do 90/70/50 (210 total) for attributes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup.<br /> <br /> That's correct.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4678-tryingtobeslim","name":"TryingToBeSlim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom